<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japan stock via 7 brokers.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japan stock via 7 brokers.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through seven foreign securities houses before the start of stock trading on Wednesday showed a net buying stance of two million shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investor sell orders totalled 14.0 million shares while buy orders amounted to 16.0 million shares.</p>
